            "image": "shopify://shop_images/file_c0f8782c-1137-402f-a70f-8afa46297258.jpg",
            "title": "Elegant & Timeless",
            "text": "<p><br/>At <strong>Savaedesign</strong>, we believe jewelry is more than just an accessory it’s a reflection of your story, confidence, and style. Each piece in our collection is thoughtfully handcrafted with love, precision, and a touch of timeless elegance.<br/><br/></p>",
